  "description": "A parcel's court auction (법원경매) items in progress, served by PNU on the parcel edge (lane parcel-court-auction), soonest sale date first. A field that is not required may be absent or null. The court's data is a public work its consumers attribute (source_attribution, 저작권법 제24조의2; root ADR-0281 §6). Revision 3 adds the parcel's 매각결과 (sale_results, newest sale date first, at most 50; sale_result_total counts them all, root ADR-0454). Revision 4 adds each round's detail, from its 물건상세 (rounds[].detail: the case, the 매각물건명세서 summary, the 기일내역, 목록내역, 제시외건물 and 감정요항표; codes stay codes; null until the property's 물건상세 is read; root ADR-0540). Revision 5 adds, beside each code of the detail, the name the site's screens give it (`*_name`: 기일종류·기일결과(매각·유찰 ...)·목록구분·물건종류·입찰구분·감정요항표 표와 항목), from the site's 공통코드 collected each run (silver.court_auction_code); null while the code has no name (root ADR-0540 §5). Revision 6 adds the case's own documents to each round's detail (root ADR-0540 §1): related_cases (관련사건·중복병합), parties (당사자 kinds and how many, never a name), objects[].closure_kind_name (목록별 종국결과), survey (the newest 현황조사 round: 조사일시, 점유관계, 임대차관계 and its 목록, names masked) and appraisal (the newest 감정평가 round: 평가번호, 가격시점, 작성일, opinion).",
